{"name": "WreckZone", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/24d3fed96f1654718f378d8779630958.poster.avif?t=1792411876\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/24d3fed96f1654718f378d8779630958.webm?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/24d3fed96f1654718f378d8779630958.mp4?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WreckZone is a fast-paced vehicular action game where speed, heavy weaponry, and insane stunts decide the outcome of every battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Intense vehicular combat with arcade physics.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get behind the wheel of one of several deadly vehicles and take part in chaotic battles across arenas, industrial complexes, deserts, and other dangerous locations. Use machine guns, rockets, mines, and special abilities to destroy your opponents before they get to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/1b9ab8f6e01c48b022ea0d202e29661b.poster.avif?t=1792411876\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/1b9ab8f6e01c48b022ea0d202e29661b.webm?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/1b9ab8f6e01c48b022ea0d202e29661b.mp4?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique vehicles with different characteristics and playstyles.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every vehicle has its own personality, weapons, and playstyle. Some rely on speed and maneuverability, while others become true armored fortresses capable of withstanding a hail of gunfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/a147d63769853cfc8b207c0f25c404d7.poster.avif?t=1792411876\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/a147d63769853cfc8b207c0f25c404d7.webm?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/a147d63769853cfc8b207c0f25c404d7.mp4?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse arenas filled with traps, dangers, and opportunities for spectacular stunts.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But victory doesn't depend on weapons alone. Master the environment, pull off risky jumps, dodge attacks, use traps, and find the best positions to strike. The arenas are filled with obstacles, destructible objects, and hazards that can become either your advantage or a deadly threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/9f22d276b7dd52fcc0ea2f5e0236a2dd.poster.avif?t=1792411876\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/9f22d276b7dd52fcc0ea2f5e0236a2dd.webm?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/extras/9f22d276b7dd52fcc0ea2f5e0236a2dd.mp4?t=1792411876\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>If you enjoy legendary vehicular combat games like Twisted Metal, Vigilante 8, and Crashday, WreckZone will deliver the familiar spirit of insane battles in a modern interpretation.</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "WreckZone is a wild vehicular action game featuring heavy weaponry, arcade physics, and spectacular stunts. Battle across dangerous arenas, use rockets, machine guns, and special abilities, destroy your opponents, and prove who\u2019s in charge!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978040/edac6963a13f35340f7427cc1b78a2849a96db60/header.jpg?t=1792411876", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Racing", "Arena Shooter", "Bullet Hell", "Action", "Combat Racing", "Driving"], "developers": "MadRider", "publishers": "MadRider", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4978040", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/NJjkUel7deY", "first_seen": 1792360800.0, "review_rank": 16}